        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "The gold miscellaneous tax above expressed in rice: 1,582.82031 koku, converted at the printed rate of eight ryō to one koku. Working backwards, this implies a gold figure of 12,662 ryō 2 bu 1 shu, two ryō more than the 12,660 actually printed in the 雜税金 column."
      },
